<title>USA: Eastman Kodak to open new Ireland facility.</title>
<headline>Eastman Kodak to open new Ireland facility.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said Thursday it will open a new production facility in Ireland in January.</p>
<p>The facility, in Youghal, will be the company's first facility in Europe to manufacture CD-recordable discs.</p>
<p>The company said it also plans to announce its worldwide expansion plans during the facility's ribbon-cutting ceremony on January 13.</p>
</text>
